WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.234 --> 00:00:02.567
-It is time to play
Egg Roulette,

00:00:02.567 --> 00:00:03.801
but I'm gonna need some help.

00:00:03.801 --> 00:00:05.234
She's one of the judges on

00:00:05.234 --> 00:00:06.767
"America's Got Talent:
Fantasy League,"

00:00:06.767 --> 00:00:11.100
premiering in January on NBC.
Please welcome Heidi Klum!

00:00:11.100 --> 00:00:12.968
[ Cheers and applause ]
-Mwah!

00:00:12.968 --> 00:00:14.667
-Yes!

00:00:14.667 --> 00:00:17.000
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Higgins, would you like
to explain how this works?

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:23.100
-Ha ha!
Yes, James.

00:00:23.100 --> 00:00:25.667
-Oh, there you are.
-In my hand...

00:00:25.667 --> 00:00:26.801
-Ooh.
-...I have one dozen

00:00:26.801 --> 00:00:28.400
Halloween eggs.

00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:30.534
Eight of them are boiled.

00:00:30.534 --> 00:00:32.634
Four of them are still raw.

00:00:32.634 --> 00:00:34.634
-Oh!
-[ Cackles ]

00:00:34.634 --> 00:00:37.434
You and Heidi will take turns
selecting one egg at a time

00:00:37.434 --> 00:00:39.367
and smashing it
upon the top of your head.

00:00:39.367 --> 00:00:40.701
-Uh-huh.
-You won't know which eggs

00:00:40.701 --> 00:00:42.400
are raw and which ones
are hard-boiled.

00:00:42.400 --> 00:00:43.434
[ Both laugh ]

00:00:43.434 --> 00:00:45.033
But once you choose an egg --

00:00:45.033 --> 00:00:49.567
-Can I change the rules?

00:00:49.567 --> 00:00:51.501
[ Laughter ]

00:00:51.501 --> 00:00:53.701
-Yeah.
-I want to crack my egg

00:00:53.701 --> 00:00:54.834
on your head.

00:00:54.834 --> 00:00:57.367
Can you crack yours on mine?

00:00:57.367 --> 00:00:59.133
-Ooh!

00:00:59.133 --> 00:01:00.501
Wait.
He's checking with the judges.

00:01:00.501 --> 00:01:03.834
-Judges? Yes!
-Oh!

00:01:03.834 --> 00:01:05.267
[ Laughter ]

00:01:05.267 --> 00:01:07.801
-I feel bad breaking an egg
in your head, though.

00:01:07.801 --> 00:01:09.801
-I don't feel bad
breaking one on yours.

00:01:09.801 --> 00:01:11.767
-There you go.
-No, I said I will --

00:01:11.767 --> 00:01:13.968
will feel bad. Okay.
-'Course not. It's me.

00:01:13.968 --> 00:01:15.601
-You're the guest.
-Well, then --

00:01:15.601 --> 00:01:18.801
-Spider webs!
-How do you like your eggs?

00:01:18.801 --> 00:01:20.834
-Hard-boiled, please.

00:01:20.834 --> 00:01:22.567
-Good luck.
Oh!

00:01:22.567 --> 00:01:26.434
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:26.434 --> 00:01:30.467
-My hands are already, like,
there.

00:01:30.467 --> 00:01:32.701
-What's wrong with you?

00:01:32.701 --> 00:01:35.067
Why would you --

00:01:35.067 --> 00:01:36.200
Why would you just do that?

00:01:36.200 --> 00:01:37.734
-It could've been
a hard-boiled egg.

00:01:37.734 --> 00:01:39.367
I didn't know.
-Why would you do that?

00:01:39.367 --> 00:01:41.033
That's not what
I wanted to happen.

00:01:41.033 --> 00:01:42.367
-James.
-Yes.

00:01:42.367 --> 00:01:44.534
-Oh!
-All right.

00:01:44.534 --> 00:01:45.968
-You've got egg on your face.

00:01:45.968 --> 00:01:48.434
-I like this game this way
much more, don't you?

00:01:48.434 --> 00:01:50.200
[ Laughter ]

00:01:50.200 --> 00:01:53.667
-I feel bad -- I can't
break an egg on your head.

00:01:53.667 --> 00:01:55.501
-You can do it.

00:01:55.501 --> 00:01:58.400
-Oh! Good luck!

00:01:58.400 --> 00:02:00.300
-I'm sorry.

00:02:00.300 --> 00:02:02.100
I'm sorry.

00:02:04.701 --> 00:02:06.200
[ Laughter ]

00:02:06.200 --> 00:02:07.467
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:07.467 --> 00:02:11.200
-[ Laughs ]

00:02:11.200 --> 00:02:12.534
-Oh, my gosh.

00:02:12.534 --> 00:02:15.634
♪♪

00:02:15.634 --> 00:02:17.367
-[ Giggles ]

00:02:17.367 --> 00:02:18.534
-Stop -- Don't wind --
Don't wind up.

00:02:18.534 --> 00:02:20.033
You're not throwing it at me.

00:02:20.033 --> 00:02:22.634
Be -- calm down.

00:02:22.634 --> 00:02:24.067
[ Laughter ]
No! No, no, no.

00:02:24.067 --> 00:02:26.334
Not in my face.
Hair. It has to be --

00:02:26.334 --> 00:02:28.267
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:28.267 --> 00:02:30.667
[ Sad tuba ]

00:02:30.667 --> 00:02:32.868
This is the worst --

00:02:32.868 --> 00:02:34.067
-I love this game!

00:02:34.067 --> 00:02:36.100
-This is the worst game
I've ever --

00:02:36.100 --> 00:02:37.834
-[ Laughing ]

00:02:37.834 --> 00:02:39.334
I love this game!

00:02:39.334 --> 00:02:42.567
-I want to congratulate
our winner, Heidi Klum.

00:02:42.567 --> 00:02:44.934
What a great game.

00:02:44.934 --> 00:02:45.968
-You're next.

00:02:45.968 --> 00:02:47.467
We're talking to Heidi
after the break.

00:02:47.467 --> 00:02:48.968
Stick around, everybody.

